<br><br>

Surface Coal Mine
<br><br>
Powered Haulage Accident
<br><br>
April 21, 2005
<br><br>
Whayne Supply Co. (AZ5)
<br><br>
at<br><br>

Point Rock Plant<br>
Central Appalachia Mining, LLC<br>
Phelps, Pike County, Kentucky<br>
ID No. 15-07010

<br><br>

Accident Investigators
<br><br>
Robert H. Bellamy<br>
Mining Engineer<br><br>

Richard A. Skrabak<br>
